    "catalogue_description": "My first map, is finally finished. PRAISE TEH BASEDGOD! This is a small map. Its a museum. It running the UGX 1.0.4 mod!!!!! Custom voices for the Drops. (Insta, DP, etc) No easter egg, and no doors. Just something that is simple! No double tap. 3 original perks. Thanks to Rorke for that tutorial on changing voices! And a special thanks to everyone who put effort into the UGX 2.0 Script placer. May the odds be forever in your favor! Enjoy my map!",
